{"results":[{"url":"https://www.propertypistol.com/projects/k-mehta-jay-shrinath-chsl-borivali-west-pid-9075","title":"K Mehta Jay Shrinath CHSL in Borivali West, Mumbai - PropertyPistol","raw_content":"1. [Home](/)\n2. /\n3. [Mumbai](/mumbai)\n4. /\n5. [Flats for sale in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n6. /\n7. [New Projects in Mumbai](/mumbai/buy/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n8. /\n9. [New Projects in Borivali West](/mumbai/buy/real-estate-projects-in-borivali-west)\n10. /\n11. K Mehta Jay Shrinath CHSL\n\n# K Mehta Jay Shrinath CHSL\n\nFlats by **[K Mehta And Company](/mumbai/buy/projects-by-k-mehta-and-company)** at Jay Shrinath Apartment, Sudhir Phadke Flyover, Pai Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India\n\nRERA\n\nP51800029479\n\nAgent RERA - A51700000043\n\nINR94.7 Lacs\n\nOnwards\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nZero Brokerage\n\nBest Price Guarantee\n\nINR94.7 Lacs\n\nOnwards\n\nConfigurations1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nPossession DateJun 2025\n\nBuilt up AreaOn request\n\nCarpet Area380 - 763\n\n* Sq.ft\n* Sq.yrd\n* Sq.mtr\n* Acres\n\nMin. Price per Sqft.INR 24.92 K per Sqft.\n\n[![Rera Kerala]()https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nP51800029479\n\nScan QR code to view RERA details","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-k-mehta-and-company-1a256b7a21b13a830","title":"Projects by K Mehta And Company in Borivali West, Mumbai - Blox.xyz","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nK Mehta And Company\n\n>\n\n![bookmark](/assets/icons/bookmark.svg)\n\nSave Search\n\nSave Search to get notified about new matching properties\n\n* Kolkata\n* Mumbai\n* Navi Mumbai\n* Pune\n* Thane\n\n![search-secondary](/assets/icons/search-secondary.svg)\n\n![mic](/assets/icons/mic.svg)\n\nMORE FILTERS\n\n![filters-secondary](/assets/icons/filters-secondary.svg)\n\nSEARCH\n\n![search-icon](/assets/icons/search-icon.svg)\n\nSearch\n\n# Projects by K Mehta And Company in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nProjects by K Mehta And Company in Borivali West, Mumbai. Verified Inventory | Direct from Developers | Dedicated Relationship Manager\n\nShowing 2 of 2 Projects\n\n* Newly Added![tick-secondary](/assets/icons/tick-secondary.svg)\n* Possession (Earliest)\n* Price (Low)\n* Price (High)\n* Carpet Area (Low)\n* Carpet Area (High)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/k-mehta-and-company-k-mehta-shree-yashodhan-elevation-1759139799.jpg)\n\n## K Mehta Shree Yashodhan\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n## ₹1.2 Cr - 1.7 Cr\n\n![share-secondary](/assets/icons/share-secondary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-primary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-primary.svg)\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nPossession\n\n30 Sep 2025\n\nCarpet Area\n\n754-1067 sq. ft.\n\nK Mehta Shree Yashodhan, a premium residential project by K Mehta And Company, offers thoughtfully designed 2 BHK & 3 BHK homes in the prime locality of Borivali West, Mumbai. Combining modern design with comfort & functionality, this project provides residents with a high-quality living experience. Strategically located, K Mehta Shree Yashodhan ensures excellent connectivity & easy access to schools, hospitals, shopping centers & transport facilities, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers seeking premium residential property in Borivali West.\n\n![near-by-locality-secondary](/assets/icons/near-by-locality-secondary.svg)\n\n### SuggestedLocations inBorivali West\n\nExplore these locations based on your search.\n\nBabhai Naka\n\nEksar\n\nIC Colony\n\nKastur Park\n\nShimpoli\n\nVazira\n\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/k-mehta-developers-jay-shrinath-chsl-bedroom-1673960961.webp)\n\n## Jay Shrinath\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n## ₹94.7 L - 2.53 Cr\n\n![share-secondary](/assets/icons/share-secondary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-primary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-primary.svg)\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nPossession\n\n30 Jun 2025\n\nCarpet Area\n\n380-1015 sq. ft.\n\nJay Shrinath by K Mehta And Company is a premium residential project in Borivali West, Mumbai, offering thoughtfully designed 1, 2 & 3 BHK homes. The project combines modern architecture with quality construction to provide comfortable & functional living spaces. Strategically located in a well-connected neighborhood, Jay Shrinath ensures easy access to schools, shopping centers, transport links & daily conveniences, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers & investors looking for high-quality homes in Borivali West’s real estate market.\n\n## Properties for sale in Mumbai\n\n## Other Developers in Borivali West\n\n* [Projects by Namo Realty in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-namo-realty-1a256b7a21b13a791)\n* [Projects by Hirani Group in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-hirani-group-1a256b7a21b13a415)\n* [Projects by RR Builders in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-rr-builders-1a256b7a21b13a360)\n* [Projects by Rawal Realty in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-rawal-realty-1a256b7a21b13a4678)\n* [Projects by Osho Developer in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-osho-developer-1a256b7a21b13a835)\n* [Projects by Konark Developer in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-konark-developer-1a256b7a21b13a5025)\n* [Projects by Manorama Corporation in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-manorama-corporation-1a256b7a21b13a674)\n* [Projects by Garuda Group in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-garuda-grou