720.webp)\n\n![](https://d3okty7coycniy.cloudfront.net/projects/670517efb3aa87129178a5fc/images/1733307962712-910958403-720.webp)\n\n# K Mehta Shree Yashodhan\n\n#### Borivali West, Mumbai, Mumbai\n\n## ₹ 1.20 Cr - ₹ 1.70 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\n3 BHK\n\n#### About This Project\n\nK Mehta Shree Yashodhan in Borivali West, Mumbai, is an under-construction project by K Mehta And Company Mumbai, offering thoughtfully designed 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments. Spread across 0.3 acres, with 18 units in a single building, the project is set to be completed by September 2025. Located off Chandavarkar Road, the property ensures a convenient and coveted lifestyle, featuring amenities like fire sprinklers, landscaping, tree planting, stormwater drains, and a sewage treatment plant. Closed car parking is provided, and the project is RERA compliant with ID P51800047642. Borivali West's connectivity enhances the appeal of this development.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nRERA Carpet Range\n\n754 - 1067 Sqft\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51800047642\n\nProject Type\n\nResidential\n\nProject Name\n\nK Mehta Shree Yashodhan\n\nPrice per Sqft\n\n₹ 15.91 K\n\nPossession Date\n\n29 September, 2025\n\nDeveloper\n\nK Mehta And Company\n\n#### Project Highlights\n\n• Three open-side properties with lush landscaped gardens, a swimming pool, Olympic-size swimming pool, tree plantation, and children's play area for a comfortable living environment.\n\n• Excellent accessibility to important landmarks.\n\n• Proximity to schools, hospitals, educational institutes, restaurants, banks, and movie theatres.\n\n• Spacious 2 BHK and 3 BHK options available for diverse living preferences.\n\n#### Amenities\n\nIndoor Games\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\nGymnasium\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nWalking Area\n\n#### Project Location\n\nK Mehta Shree Yashodhan, at, Borivali, Mumbai, Maharashtra.400091\n\nLoading...\n\n##### Configuration\n\n##### Carpet Area\n\n