i-west-mumbai-l1493) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: K Mehta](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-k-mehta-d9642)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Rokadia Cross Lane, Pai Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400091.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 72.66 Lakhs to 2.84 Cr\\*\n\n![K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/58166/1621944002_e3.png \"K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower\")\n\n# K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower in Borivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/58166/1621944002_e3.png \"K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 RK+1T,2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 234 sqft - 914 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 92 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 1 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2019\n* Rera: P51800000873\n\n## About\n\nK Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 1 Acres, the project features 92 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 RK+1T, to 3 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 234 sqft to 914 sqft. The address for the project is rokadia cross lane, pai nagar, borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400091..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 RK+1T units start at 234 sqft. The larger 3 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 914 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower are designed to be accessible, with 1 RK+1T units priced from 72.66 Lakhs and 3 BHK+3T Apartments from 2.84 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by K Mehta, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800000873 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2019-12-10, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nK Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 1 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 92 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 234 sqft to 914 sqft\n* Project Address: rokadia cross lane, pai nagar, borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400091.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: K Mehta\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800000873 Units\n* Possession Start: 2019-12-10\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nK Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower benefits from its location in Borivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at K Mehta Shree Rasraj Tower will begin in 2019-12-10, and the project is RERA registered under P51800000873 Units. Developed by K Mehta, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Conv